(r1['content']))' due to: InterpreterError: Forbidden function evaluation: 'repr' is not among the explicitly allowed tools or defined/imported in the preceding code\nEvidence ev-0fae89961d303fffa5a6 | report.json | lines:1-1 | sha256=ca3d163bab055381827226140568f3bef7eaac187cebd76878e0b63e9e442356\n{}\n"}]}], "model": "deepseek-flash", "max_tokens": 16384, "reasoning_effort": "high", "stop": ["Observation:", "Calling tools:"], "thinking": {"type": "enabled"}}, "chars": 16291, "content_chars": 15301, "course_content_chars": 16033}
