We can record general reasoning note now. But note should ultimately contain answers. We can add incremental later, preserving. Each final note must contain two answers. Current note can record taxonomy, CoT, table. But overview answer already. We need advance pages. We can write reasoning preliminary note with pp7-8 supported facts, then next batch. Let's do that. Need content 20-1500, exact quotes supporting current facts. Then next batch delivered.\n\nWe'll write reasoning note."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8572, "completion_tokens": 519, "total_tokens": 9091, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4352}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 246}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4352, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4220}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
