et al. find one standard phrase 'Let's think step by step' significantly improves performance. Still need exact Self Consistency selection rule and ToT's two search controllers from pp.10-13.\",\n  evidence_ids=[\"ev-5803bf1c9a0002a5bd4f\", \"ev-f5fa865a87a2cd077881\", \"ev-419793694ae75f1e2b97\"],\n  section=\"reasoning\"\n)", "observations": "Execution logs:\nLast output from code snippet:\n{'note_id': 'reasoning', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 634}", "observations_images": null, "action_output": {"note_id": "reasoning", "sources": ["paper.pdf"], "chars": 634}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8572, "output_tokens": 519, "total_tokens": 9091}, "is_final_answer": false}}
