for the same LLM to come up with a better answer'; framed as RL where both agent and environment are the LLM with different prompts; needs external memory. p.14-15 PHP, Self Refine (p_gen, p_fb, p_refine), Reflexion (actor/evaluator/reflector), Self Discover, Buffer of Thoughts. p.16 implicit reasoning: Self taught reasoner, DeepSeek-R1/GRPO, RASP program emulation. p.10-11 PoT, PAL, FunSearch, PDDL planners; long chains risk hallucination.\",\n  evidence_ids=[\"ev-d2b420a2b23cdc8166d3\",\"ev-4049593a30e2846f8394\",\"ev-2c5302116a7f6c84effa\",\"ev-b8db09947ef7c899cd9d\",\"ev-ced75d6936911b2f0248\"],\n  section=\"reasoning\"\n)", "observations": "Execution logs:\nLast output from code snippet:\n{'note_id': 'reasoning', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 1260}", "observations_images": null, "action_output": {"note_id": "reasoning", "sources": ["paper.pdf"], "chars": 1260}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8090, "output_tokens": 716, "total_tokens": 8806}, "is_final_answer": false}}
