d notes from what I received (tool_use already done). Now I need multi_agent info (pages ~27-33) and outlook (Table 4, conclusion, ~pp.48-52).\n\nSince I don't know evidence ids for later pages, maybe recall tool with ids unknown. Actually maybe I can just call read_pdf again? No — it says don't call read_pdf to advance.\n\nHmm. Perhaps the pending batch will be delivered automatically if I take an action. Let me write a note update for tool_use including safety info, and then continue.\n\nActually a simpler approach: take an action that queues the pending evidence - the \"Not fully delivered yet\" ids. recall(those ids) would deliver them. But they're probably pages 27+.\n\nLet me recall those 8 ids to get them delivered next."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8667, "completion_tokens": 625, "total_tokens": 9292, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4352}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 271}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4352, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4315}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
