ptTokensDetails", "audio_tokens": null, "cache_write_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 4352}}, "_request_id": null}, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8667, "output_tokens": 625, "total_tokens": 9292}}, "model_output": "Recording additional tool_use detail (agent interoperability, safety) and queuing the pending evidence.\n\n```python\nr = write_note(title=\"tool_use\", section=\"tool_use\", evidence_ids=[\"ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62\",\"ev-4e747765f5046c8ad8b1\"], content=\"Tool use = category 2 acting (pp.20-25). p.23 exact: 'A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.' -> toolformer_tools: calculator, question_answering, search_engine, translation_system, calendar. p.23 exact: 'ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.' -> toolbench_api_count: 16464. p.24: computer/browser tools (OmniParser V2, Computer Use, Operator, Browser Use), interoperability protocols MCP/ACP/ANP/A2A. p.24-25 safety: AgentHarm 110 malicious tasks; Rainbow Teaming quality-diversity adversarial prompts (MAP-Elites). p.25-26 assistants: AssistantGPT (LLM+tools+planner+memory), meeting assistants, MUCA, thinking assistant.\")\nprint(r)\nprint(recall([\"ev-1e23be7c32e2bf283689\",\"ev-eb42e63472799e638c3f\",\"ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d\",\"ev-97c7764bd93b97111551\"]))\n```", "code_action": "r = write_note(title=\"tool_use\", section=\"tool_use\", evidence_ids=[\"ev-731fa63b8d34dde45e62\",\"ev-4e747765f5046c8ad8b1\"], content=\"Tool use = category 2 acting (pp.20-25). p.23 exact: 'A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.' -> toolformer_tools: calculator, question_answering, search_engine, translation_system, calendar. p.23 exact: 'ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.' -> toolbench_api_count: 16464. p.24: computer/browser tools (OmniParser V2, Computer Use, Operator, Browser Use), interoperability protocols MCP/ACP/ANP/A2A. p.24-25 safety: AgentHarm 110 malicious tasks; Rainbow Teaming quality-diversity adversarial prompts (MAP-Elites). p.25-26 assistants: AssistantGPT (LLM+tools+planner+memory), meeting assistants, MUCA, thinking assistant.\")\nprint(r)\nprint(recall([\"ev-1e23be7c32e2bf283689\",\"ev-eb42e63472799e638c3f\",\"ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d\",\"ev-97c7764bd93b97111551\"]))", "observations": "Execution logs:\n{'note_id': 'tool_use', 'sources': ['paper.pdf'], 'chars': 786}\n{'requested': [{'id': 'ev-1e23be7c32e2bf283689', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:27'}, {'id': 'ev-eb42e63472799e638c3f', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:28'}, {'id': 'ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:29'}, {'id': 'ev-97c7764bd93b97111551', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:30'}], 'queued': [{'id': 'ev-1e23be7c32e2bf283689', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:27'}, {'id': 'ev-eb42e63472799e638c3f', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:28'}, {'id': 'ev-81117fe71aa5d10b548d', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:29'}, {'id': 'ev-97c7764bd93b97111551', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:30'}, {'id': 'ev-2c646589154451e7b722', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:31'}, {'id': 'ev-1d8af21fdc46c86a5055', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:32'}, {'id': 'ev-e403dfb2811682ecd186', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:33'}, {'id': 'ev-41048209f3096e51f36b', 'source': 'paper.pdf', 'locator': 'page:34'}], 'requested_count': 4, 'queued_count': 26, 'message': 'Queued, not delivered; the selector chooses the actual next batch.'}\nLast output from code snippet:\nNone", "observations_images": null, "action_output": null, "token_usage": {"input_tokens": 8667, "output_tokens": 625, "total_tokens": 9292}, "is_final_answer": false}}
