`", "reasoning_content": "We need continue reading pages 40-52 delivered batch pending? Evidence delivered now pages 37-39. Need update multi_agent note with CAMEL inception prompting and Generative Agents evaluator count likely page 40 evaluation. Need wait next batches. We can use write_note to update multi_agent preserving facts and CAMEL answer. Need evidence ids from page 37. We have ev-98a30db9253fff6cc9da. CAMEL prompting = inception prompting. Generative Agents evaluators unknown, likely 100? Need page 40. Let's update note now preserving earlier and adding CAMEL, page 37. Then pending batch auto advances? It says \"The next batch follows successful actions automatically.\" So write_note action may prompt next delivery. Need include note content in prose before code. Keep under 1500 chars.\n\nWe need be careful: current multi_agent note 860 chars; add CAMEL info may reach ~1100. It must contain both answers eventually. For now CAMEL only. Use same title incremental update. Content one string literal and exact in prose. Let's write."}, "logprobs": null, "finish_reason": "stop"}], "usage": {"prompt_tokens": 8737, "completion_tokens": 643, "total_tokens": 9380, "prompt_tokens_details": {"cached_tokens": 4352}, "completion_tokens_details": {"reasoning_tokens": 229}, "prompt_cache_hit_tokens": 4352, "prompt_cache_miss_tokens": 4385}, "system_fingerprint": "bc19ba97cbe016479903222bb1578db6"}, "classification": "ok"}
