分工的多智能体讨论，以及把执行轨迹沉淀为可复用的反思笔记。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"categories\": [\"reason\", \"act\", \"interact\"],\n        \"search_methods\": [\"google_scholar_search\", \"snowballing\"]\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"question\": \"categories\", \"page\": 4, \"quote\": \"The categories reasoning–acting–interacting build upon each other: the technology that has been developed by the reasoning approaches (category 1) is used for increasingly intelligent acting by assistants.\"},\n        {\"question\": \"search_methods\", \"page\": 5, \"quote\": \"The papers were initially selected with a Google Scholar search on Agentic LLM. From there, we used a snowballing approach to discover work that was cited but not yet included in our initial set.\"}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"reasoning\",\n      \"summary\": \"推理主题按多步推理、自反思、检索增强展开。Self Consistency 属于多路径集成方法：对同一问题采样多条不同推理路径，再对各路径结果做多数投票，选出最一致的答案，因此关键在于“投票”而非单条链的置信度。Tree of Thoughts 把推理组织为树，由外部控制算法反复以不同提示调用模型，一条路径走完后回溯尝试替代分支，论文给出广度优先与深度优先两种搜索控制器。自反思让模型评估自身预测并生成更好提示，Reflexion 等系统需要外部记忆；隐式推理则可把推理能力训练进模型，如 DeepSeek-R1。局限是长链推理仍可能累积幻觉。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 目前是单路径执行，没有对同一任务采样多条轨迹再投票，也没有显式的树搜索与回溯。可以改进为：对关键判断采样多次并按多数投票定稿，或在页面筛选时用广度优先探索候选批次、失败时回溯。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"self_consistency_selection\": \"majority voting\",\n        \"tot_search\": [\"breadth_first\", \"depth_first\"]\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"question\": \"self_consistency_selection\", \"page\": 10, \"quote\": \"Self Consistency is an ensemble approach that samples diverse reasoning paths, evaluates them, and selects the most consistent answer using majority voting.\"},\n        {\"question\": \"tot_search\", \"page\": 13, \"quote\": \"Here, an external control algorithm is created, that calls the model, each time with a different prompt, so that it follows a tree of reasoning steps. When one reasoning path has been traversed, the search backtracks, and tries an alternative. The paper describes both a breadth-first and a depth-first controller.\"}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"tool_use\",\n      \"summary\": \"工具使用属于行动类能力：模型通过调用外部服务扩展自身边界。Toolformer 以自监督方式让模型学会在文本中插入 API 调用，测试的工具包括计算器、问答系统、搜索引擎、翻译系统和日历，说明工具调用可由模型自行标注训练。ToolBench 则提供大规模 API 数据集，包含来自 RapidAPI 的 16,464 个公开 REST API，用于训练和评测多工具调用。文中还讨论计算机与浏览器工具、智能体互操作协议以及工具调用的安全风险，如恶意任务基准与对抗提示生成。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 已通过命令工具真实调用 read_pdf.py 和 pytest，并把 command_result 完整保存，这正是工具使用的落地形式。不足之处是工具集合固定、没有按需发现新 API，也没有对工具返回做安全审查。未来可增加工具注册与自动选择，并对命令输出做校验与回退。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"toolformer_tools\": [\"calculator\", \"question_answering\", \"search_engine\", \"translation\", \"calendar\"],\n        \"toolbench_api_count\": 16464\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"question\": \"toolformer_tools\", \"page\": 23, \"quote\": \"A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.\"},\n        {\"question\": \"toolbench_api_count\", \"page\": 23, \"quote\": \"ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\"}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"multi_agent\",\n      \"summary\": \"交互主题关注多个 LLM 智能体之间的自然语言通信：角色扮演、团队合作、博弈与社会模拟。CAMEL 用 inception prompt 指定用户与助手角色，让两个智能体在初始想法引导下保持身份并协作完成任务。Generative Agents 在角色之外加入记忆、计划与反思模块，产生可信的日常行为；其可信度由 100 名人类评估者判断。文中还介绍 Sotopia、GovSim 等社会目标与合作评测，以及用 1052 个访谈智能体复现问卷的千人模拟实验，观察到涌现行为，也观察到不稳定与幻觉。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 目前是单智能体流水线，尚未实现角色分工与消息交换，因此 multi-agent 只是未来建议。可先尝试两角色协作：一个负责页面筛选与笔记，一个负责核对引用与格式；但需注意多智能体也会带来不一致与幻觉。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"camel_prompting\": \"inception_prompting\",\n        \"generative_agents_evaluators\": 100\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"question\": \"camel_prompting\", \"page\": 46, \"quote\": \"Both agents are given a so-called inception prompt, an initial idea.\"},\n        {\"question\": \"generative_agents_evaluators\", \"page\": 47