ool_use\",\n      \"summary\": \"工具使用属于行动类能力：模型通过调用外部服务扩展自身边界。Toolformer 以自监督方式让模型学会在文本中插入 API 调用，测试的工具包括计算器、问答系统、搜索引擎、翻译系统和日历，说明工具调用可由模型自行标注训练。ToolBench 则提供大规模 API 数据集，包含来自 RapidAPI 的 16,464 个公开 REST API，用于训练和评测多工具调用。文中还讨论计算机与浏览器工具、智能体互操作协议以及工具调用的安全风险，如恶意任务基准与对抗提示生成。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 已通过命令工具真实调用 read_pdf.py 和 pytest，并把 command_result 完整保存，这正是工具使用的落地形式。不足之处是工具集合固定、没有按需发现新 API，也没有对工具返回做安全审查。未来可增加工具注册与自动选择，并对命令输出做校验与回退。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"toolformer_tools\": [\"calculator\", \"question_answering\", \"search_engine\", \"translation\", \"calendar\"],\n        \"toolbench_api_count\": 16464\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"question\": \"toolformer_tools\", \"page\": 23, \"quote\": \"A range of tools is tested: a calculator, a question-answering system, a search engine, a translation system, and a calendar.\"},\n        {\"question\": \"toolbench_api_count\", \"page\": 23, \"quote\": \"ToolBench [Qin et al., 2023] contains 16,464 APIs from RapidAPI, a large dataset of publicly available REST APIs.\"}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"multi_agent\",\n      \"summary\": \"交互主题关注多个 LLM 智能体之间的自然语言通信：角色扮演、团队合作、博弈与社会模拟。CAMEL 用 inception prompt 指定用户与助手角色，让两个智能体在初始想法引导下保持身份并协作完成任务。Generative Agents 在角色之外加入记忆、计划与反思模块，产生可信的日常行为；其可信度由 100 名人类评估者判断。文中还介绍 Sotopia、GovSim 等社会目标与合作评测，以及用 1052 个访谈智能体复现问卷的千人模拟实验，观察到涌现行为，也观察到不稳定与幻觉。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 目前是单智能体流水线，尚未实现角色分工与消息交换，因此 multi-agent 只是未来建议。可先尝试两角色协作：一个负责页面筛选与笔记，一个负责核对引用与格式；但需注意多智能体也会带来不一致与幻觉。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"camel_prompting\": \"inception_prompting\",\n        \"generative_agents_evaluators\": 100\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"question\": \"camel_prompting\", \"page\": 46, \"quote\": \"Both agents are given a so-called inception prompt, an initial idea.\"},\n        {\"question\": \"generative_agents_evaluators\", \"page\": 47, \"quote\": \"Whether the Generative Agents system generates believable behavior is evaluated with the help of 100 human evaluators.\"}\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"outlook\",\n      \"summary\": \"Table 4 把未来工作归为五个议题：训练数据、幻觉、智能体行为、自反思与安全。训练数据方面强调用推理期数据微调、稳定的强化学习以及多模态信号；幻觉方面主张自验证、机制可解释性与开放世界模型探索；智能体行为需要可扩展的模拟基础设施、角色扮演与社会行为建模；自反思指向模型内反思与元推理；安全则涉及助手的责任、隐私与公平。结论指出三类能力都受益于推理与自验证这两项基础能力，例如工具使用建立在有依据的检索增强之上，社会互动建立在自反思之上。\",\n      \"application\": \"我的 agent 已有证据版本化与 pytest 验证，可视为初级的自验证；但缺少对生成报告的事实核验与不确定性标注。未来可在写报告后增加一次自动核对（答案—引文—页码一致性检查），并为高风险工具调用加人工确认。多智能体协作与训练数据回流仍属未来设想。\",\n      \"answers\": {\n        \"agenda_topics\": [\"training_data\", \"hallucination\", \"agent_behavior\", \"self_reflection\", \"safety\"],\n        \"shared_foundations\": [\"reasoning\", \"self_verification\"]\n      },\n      \"evidence\": [\n        {\"question\": \"agenda_topics\", \"page\": 51, \"quote\": \"Topic Challenge Training Data Finetune with inference time reasoning data Convergent/stable reinforcement learning VLA, Multimodal signals, such as speech Hallucination Use Self Verification Use Mechanistic Interpretability Use Open Ended/Open World Models for exploration Agent Behavior Scalable simulation infrastructure, role playing Distill reasoning to small models Models of agent and human behavior, emergent behavior, future of society Self reflection In-model self reflection and metareasoning Metacognition, personality Automated Scientific Discovery Safety Assistants: Responsibility, liability Privacy, fairness of data Wider application areas for assistants\"},\n        {\"question\": \"shared_foundations\", \"page\": 52, \"quote\": \"Robotic interaction and tool-use build on grounded retrieval augmentation, social interaction (such as theory of mind) builds on self reflection, and all categories benefit from reasoning and self-verification.\"}\n      ]\n    }\n  ]\n}\nw = write_file('report.json', json.dumps(report, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2), 'ca3d163bab055381827226140568f3bef7eaac187cebd76878e0b63e9e442356')\nprint(w['rc'] if 'rc' in w else w)\n```", "code_acti